# Rank 2 Mission (battlefield.rank_2_mission, Balgas Dais: a plain Battlefield with its own entryRequirement and
# checkSkipCutscene; index 0, no fixed area, 15 minutes, 6 players, isMission, Black_Dragon and Searcher essential, no
# loot, Burning_Circle the exit) by a San d'Oria char. A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with Journey to Windurst (the
# second) current at status 8. Without the Dark Key BC_Entrance plays NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY (7251), and so does a trade
# (a Chunk of Copper Ore). With the Dark Key (a GM): the menu; area 1 (option 1): registered, entered. The pair spawns
# at the first tick; Black_Dragon and Searcher of arena 1 killed: no crate: the cutscene timer, WON; at the fifth tick
# after it the cleanup: battlefieldWin, 32001; finished: no title, no XP; San d'Oria's handler moves to status 9 and
# gives the Kindred Crest.
lists BalgasDais/BC_Entrance/onTrigger BalgasDais/BC_Entrance/onTrade BalgasDais/onEventUpdate/32000 BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32000 BalgasDais/Burning_Circle/onTrigger BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32003 BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32001
